# jdbc-test literal dotenv v1
# SOURCE DEVELOPMENT: copy THIS file to source-root .env only when absent,
# edit the three SPRING_DATASOURCE fields there, then run ./jdbc-test dev.
# 源码开发：仅在不存在时复制本文件为源码根 .env，编辑三项后执行 ./jdbc-test dev。
# PowerShell: ./jdbc-test.ps1 dev. Never overwrite an existing .env/Key.
# Bundle: same copy/edit flow in the extracted bundle; use ./jdbc-test start.
# The entry protects the owner's local file before reading; keep it outside Git.
# Raw values retain spaces, #, $, ${NAME}, = and backslashes; NO inline comments.
# Double quotes use JSON escapes; single quotes are literal. NEVER source/eval.
# 平台 PG 预先准备，不是目标测试库。URL 含库名，账号密码单独填写。
SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/jdbc_test
SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME=jdbc_test
SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD=
# Tool fills this ONLY after confirming NEW + checking empty platform/data.
# New: leave empty. Existing: restore/reuse the ORIGINAL Key; never regenerate.
# 全新环境留空，确认 NEW 后工具保存；已有环境恢复原 Key，不能每次生成。
JDBC_TEST_MASTER_KEY=
SERVER_PORT=8080
# Optional source Vite port / 可选源码前端端口：
# JDBC_TEST_WEB_PORT=5173
# DOCKER EXISTING PG uses the same fields, with a container-reachable URL:
# Host PG: jdbc:postgresql://host.docker.internal:5432/jdbc_test
# Docker Desktop supports that host; Linux also needs docker --external-pg --host-pg.
# Remote PG: jdbc:postgresql://pg.example.com:5432/jdbc_test
# Container localhost is the container itself; addresses are never rewritten.
# DOCKER BUNDLED PG: do NOT copy this external-PG example. In a confirmed new
# directory without .env use ./jdbc-test docker --bundled-pg; it generates
# POSTGRES_DB/USER/PASSWORD and independent Key. Compose decides the URL:
# jdbc:postgresql://postgres:5432/${POSTGRES_DB:-jdbc_test}
# 两种 Docker 模式明确选择，不能混用；已有 PG 不需要 POSTGRES_PASSWORD。
